          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welili chatama kumesu aYehova; halekeli munshidi jamwana kaNebati Yerobowami javulumwishiliyi nachu aIsarelaku.",
